{"suttaId":"tha-ap458","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1179,1194],"vripara":"32"},"segments":{"tha-ap458:0.3":"Vanakoraṇḍiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap458:1.1":"“Siddhatthassa bhagavato, lokajeṭṭhassa tādino;","tha-ap458:1.3":"Vanakoraṇḍamādāya, buddhassa abhiropayiṃ.","tha-ap458:2.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap458:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap458:3.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap458:4.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap458:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap458:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā vanakoraṇḍiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap458:7.1":"Vanakoraṇḍiyattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ.","tha-ap458:7.2":"Vīsatimaṃ bhāṇavāraṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
